# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Credit Card Statement Tracker — Environment Variables
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# .env is gitignored and will never be committed.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Database ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Path to the SQLite database file. Default: data/tracker.db
# DB_PATH=data/tracker.db

# ── Statement Passwords ─────────────────────────────────────────
# PDF passwords for each bank's credit card statements.
# Add a key for each bank you use, following the pattern:
#   <BANK>_SAMPLE_PASSWORD=your_pdf_password
#
# Supported banks:
HDFC_SAMPLE_PASSWORD=
ICICI_SAMPLE_PASSWORD=
SBI_SAMPLE_PASSWORD=
INDUSIND_SAMPLE_PASSWORD=

# ── AI-Assisted Parsing (Optional) ──────────────────────────────
# Required only if you enable the LLM-assist toggle for banks
# without a dedicated parser. Uses Google Gemini API.
# Also powers the natural-language spending commentary on the
# analytics dashboard.
#
# Get your key at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash
